# VMD headless render: plain molecular geometry preview (no isosurface)
display resize 2400 1800
display projection Orthographic
display depthcue off
display rendermode GLSL
color Display Background white
axes location off

mol new water_density.cub
mol delrep 0 0

mol representation Licorice 0.12 25.0
mol color Element
mol selection {all}
mol material Opaque
mol addrep 0

mol representation VDW 0.35 25.0
mol color Element
mol selection {all}
mol material Opaque
mol addrep 0

rotate x by 0
rotate y by 90
rotate z by 90
scale by 0.85

light 0 on
light 1 on
light 2 off
light 3 on

render Tachyon mol-preview-scene.dat
puts "SCENE_WRITTEN"
quit
